    "name": "Adventurer's Gambit: Dungeons of Fortune",
    "steam_appid": 2603930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/87fb4919ed0ff4ecade81975331d8578.avif?t=1739406425\" width=616 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Tower! Carve, blast, and bite your way through the monsters inhabiting the endless Tower; claim the riches within, and increase your might! Push through the dangers, and maybe you'll have a chance to uncover the ancient mysteries that draw heroes like yourself to this place... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3a00b7f7984e5165a65c7fab02eedf81.poster.avif?t=1739406425\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3a00b7f7984e5165a65c7fab02eedf81.webm?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3a00b7f7984e5165a65c7fab02eedf81.mp4?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the heroes seeking to ascend to champion status, Adventurer's Gambit: Dungeons of Fortune blends extraction gameplay and RPG mechanics into a fast-paced experience for both PvE and PvP gamers. Explore dynamically generated dungeon floors of the Tower alone or with friends, with a unique asynchronous online multiplayer system allowing for both cooperative and competitive play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition into the Tower is a high-risk, high-reward venture. As you overcome the monsters while dungeon crawling, you'll have to contend with the constant threat of room collapse, complex puzzles, and the risk of betrayal that will keep you on your toes. Will you extract safely with the loot and grow stronger? Can you trust your fellow heroes to control their greed? Can you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/edd4bf5aec5ddc99a8a8b510c2109748.avif?t=1739406425\" width=616 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3f4f1759e481127d8499e77bd5b4d155.poster.avif?t=1739406425\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3f4f1759e481127d8499e77bd5b4d155.webm?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3f4f1759e481127d8499e77bd5b4d155.mp4?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The treacherous depths of the Tower provide an opportunity for power and glory that will only grow over time. Loot and experience make you stronger, unlocking more options for your ability deck. Customize your playstyle and ascend the way you prefer. But remember, with great power come great challenges. You will have to adapt and improve\u2014and overcoming these dangers leads to even greater rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/f64bf0aa71f02605e4ecc5aae1e075c9.avif?t=1739406425\" width=616 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/a1cecc7fa2965c3c7e7f2ac02960a579.poster.avif?t=1739406425\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/a1cecc7fa2965c3c7e7f2ac02960a579.webm?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/a1cecc7fa2965c3c7e7f2ac02960a579.mp4?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered among the stones of the Tower's countless dungeon floors are fragments of ancient myths, artifacts, remnants of past glories, and heroes. Every step you take brings you closer to revealing the mystery. Will you be strong enough to survive and unravel it? Or will you fall, like countless heroes before you, adding another chapter to the Tower's mysterious history?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/87fb4919ed0ff4ecade81975331d8578.avif?t=1739406425\" width=616 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Tower! Carve, blast, and bite your way through the monsters inhabiting the endless Tower; claim the riches within, and increase your might! Push through the dangers, and maybe you'll have a chance to uncover the ancient mysteries that draw heroes like yourself to this place... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3a00b7f7984e5165a65c7fab02eedf81.poster.avif?t=1739406425\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3a00b7f7984e5165a65c7fab02eedf81.webm?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3a00b7f7984e5165a65c7fab02eedf81.mp4?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the heroes seeking to ascend to champion status, Adventurer's Gambit: Dungeons of Fortune blends extraction gameplay and RPG mechanics into a fast-paced experience for both PvE and PvP gamers. Explore dynamically generated dungeon floors of the Tower alone or with friends, with a unique asynchronous online multiplayer system allowing for both cooperative and competitive play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition into the Tower is a high-risk, high-reward venture. As you overcome the monsters while dungeon crawling, you'll have to contend with the constant threat of room collapse, complex puzzles, and the risk of betrayal that will keep you on your toes. Will you extract safely with the loot and grow stronger? Can you trust your fellow heroes to control their greed? Can you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/edd4bf5aec5ddc99a8a8b510c2109748.avif?t=1739406425\" width=616 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3f4f1759e481127d8499e77bd5b4d155.poster.avif?t=1739406425\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3f4f1759e481127d8499e77bd5b4d155.webm?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/3f4f1759e481127d8499e77bd5b4d155.mp4?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The treacherous depths of the Tower provide an opportunity for power and glory that will only grow over time. Loot and experience make you stronger, unlocking more options for your ability deck. Customize your playstyle and ascend the way you prefer. But remember, with great power come great challenges. You will have to adapt and improve\u2014and overcoming these dangers leads to even greater rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/f64bf0aa71f02605e4ecc5aae1e075c9.avif?t=1739406425\" width=616 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/a1cecc7fa2965c3c7e7f2ac02960a579.poster.avif?t=1739406425\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/a1cecc7fa2965c3c7e7f2ac02960a579.webm?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603930/extras/a1cecc7fa2965c3c7e7f2ac02960a579.mp4?t=1739406425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered among the stones of the Tower's countless dungeon floors are fragments of ancient myths, artifacts, remnants of past glories, and heroes. Every step you take brings you closer to revealing the mystery. Will you be strong enough to survive and unravel it? Or will you fall, like countless heroes before you, adding another chapter to the Tower's mysterious history?</p>",
    "short_description": "Ascend the Tower! Create your hero, enter the endlessly varied dungeons alone, or team up with up to 3 friends to battle against 18 foes! Prevail by blade, magic, or curse... or join the bones rattling amidst the rubble. Are you up to the challenge? The Tower awaits!",
